          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zephaniah the priest read this letter in the hearing of Jeremiah the prophet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came to Jeremiah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Send to all the exiles, saying, ‘Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " concerning Shemaiah of Nehelam: Because Shemaiah had prophesied to you when I did not send him, and has made you trust in a lie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": Behold, I will punish Shemaiah of Nehelam and his descendants; he shall not have any one living among this people to see",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
